
Febuary 2, 1999

Due to a mistake, the LNKS5.OPO server included with version 0.30a didn't
run with the version of the OPX-libraries included in the distribution 
archive. This new version corrects that error. If you have a working
version 0.30a, there is no need to upgrade, as this version does not
add any functionality, just this fix.

Erik Huelsmann
HCS Software
